      "datastore_contains_all_records_of_source_file": false,
      "description": "The repository's content documents the conception of structured description templates and structured evaluation questionnaires for educational images, with the objective to improve accessibility for blind and visually impaired users. \r\n\r\nIncluded: \r\n**Description_Criteria_with_ Interview_Excerpts.pdf** -- Derived core criteria for efficient descriptions, and excerpts from the performed expert interviews that led to their formulation. \r\n**Templates for Image Descriptions.pdf** -- Structured image description templates \r\n**Questionnaire Questions.pdf** -- Structured evaluation questionnaire\r\n**Image Description Overview.pdf** -- Entry document with links to (a) used example images, (b) description derived based on structured templates, (c) control description from formal description templates from an expert institution\r\n**Template-based Image Descriptions** -- Folder containing sample images and corresponding descriptions, (a) using our template-based description approach, (b) control description from formal description templates from an expert institution\r\n",
